WEBVTT

00:02:27.621 --> 00:02:31.913
Character and happiness or misery
are not substitutes.

00:02:32.538 --> 00:02:36.621
The idea which has been accepted both
in the UK and in many other places,

00:02:36.621 --> 00:02:41.663
other than quite a few other countries by
now, is that the objective of society?

00:02:41.704 --> 00:02:46.579
The objective of policy should
be increasing human welfare

00:02:46.829 --> 00:02:50.371
or human well-being in a in a general way.

00:02:50.871 --> 00:02:58.954
I think that's a better objective for
policy than increasing the quality of

00:02:58.954 --> 00:03:02.204
the population's character. I think
it's a better objective.